# M4.2a — AXIOM-Compute ggml-ABI-matched Q4_K_M coopmat-KHR substitution patch.
#
# Target: ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp
# Pinned SHA: 6b80c74f285390368b3c99c5e750f19e9b096e98 (tag b9542)
# Build flag: GGML_VULKAN_AXIOM_Q4K (opt-in; NEVER default — every hunk is `#ifdef`-guarded).
#
# Three hunks, two logical SITES (per the M4.2a milestone spec Sec.7.2):
#   1. A small `vk_device_struct` member declaration (~:736) — the standalone pipeline slot.
#      Bundled with the "pipeline creation" site (it is inert without the creation hunk).
#   2. Pipeline CREATION (~:4159, INSIDE the coopmat block [:4090,:4211]) — builds ONE
#      standalone AXIOM `_cm1` pipeline (fixed 32x32 tile, wg_denoms={32,32,1}).
#   3. Dispatch SELECTION override (~:8239, at the `ggml_vk_guess_matmul_pipeline` call site in
#      `ggml_vk_mul_mat_q_f16`) — reassigns `pipeline` under the full 13-condition guard,
#      fail-closed otherwise. ONE interception point covers all SIX stock variants
#      (l/m/s/a_l/a_m/a_s), alignment-independent.
#
# HAND-WRITTEN against the pinned source (git apply --check verified in the coder pass — see
# AT-2998 / m42a_patch_applies.rs); NOT compiled/executed in this milestone (M4.2a explicit
# out-of-scope: "No building/running the patched llama.cpp"). The executed real-ggml ABI smoke
# is a HARD precondition of the RFC-open trigger (spec Sec.7.5) — see upstream/REPRODUCE.md for
# the deferred build+run steps and the ONE known local-variable-fidelity caveat (condition #8's
# split_k check, documented inline below).
#
# Requires the byte-array fragment `upstream/matmul_q4_k_f32_cm1_axiom_data.hpp.fragment`
# (declares `matmul_q4_k_f32_cm1_axiom_len` / `matmul_q4_k_f32_cm1_axiom_data`) to be embedded
# into the generated `ggml-vulkan-shaders.hpp`/`.cpp` pair BEFORE this patch is applied — the
# `extern` declarations inside the creation hunk assume that symbol exists at link time.
#
--- a/ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp
+++ b/ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp
@@ -734,6 +734,14 @@
